{"chapter": "categories", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "04VB", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$\\mathcal{C}$", "MATH_0002": "$S$", "MATH_0003": "$S^{-1}\\mathcal{C}$"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-multiplicative-system}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:6a7d0a9ec26060440f0b4bc961b10187c1ce41af8710c7eaeae155b441e30af2", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:3cdfc95a39dc264f023eef4efcae3ac9aed36768b62123ef4584a3f63430f2cb", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a category and let <MATH_0002> be a multiplicative system.\nThe category of left fractions and the category of right fractions\n<MATH_0003> are canonically isomorphic.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:38a97eb9ea3e7d1f3439bbd2ff05b3add3915e79b5379d5cff9358fbff25fe58", "unit_id": "tag:04VL:statement"}
{"chapter": "categories", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "04VB", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$\\mathcal{C}_{left}$", "MATH_0002": "$\\mathcal{C}_{right}$", "MATH_0003": "$\\mathcal{C}_{left} \\to \\mathcal{C}_{right}$", "MATH_0004": "$\\mathcal{C}_{right} \\to \\mathcal{C}_{left}$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{lemma-properties-left-localization}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{lemma-properties-right-localization}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:ffbc1c4cafb2d91e1f8521dcd76bf4ebcb279767e761e30cf3edcb9bd1849cbd", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:fe20873525090bff7a8bbedf2f8551ab03a498469e1c702408dee0b3bae0fbe4", "source_text": "Denote <MATH_0001>, <MATH_0002> the two categories\nof fractions. By the universal properties of\nLemmas <REF_0001> and\n<REF_0002>\nwe obtain functors <MATH_0003>\nand <MATH_0004>.\nBy the uniqueness statement in the universal properties, these\nfunctors are each other's inverse.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:0304f85b9e413cc7b3d4637f3ad1746a30fc9a4bd8883527a542175cf56781a3", "unit_id": "tag:04VL:proof"}
